/*!
    \page qtquickstudio-components-index.html
    \title Qt Quick Studio Components
    \brief Provides a set of components enhanced for creating animated UIs.

    The Qt Quick Studio Components module provides preset components enhanced
    for creating animated UIs that inherit \l {Qt Quick Shapes QML Types}.

    \image studio-shapes.png "Components in \QDS"

    \section1 Getting Started

    To import the QML types into your application, use the following import
    statement in your .qml file:

    \code
    import QtQuick.Studio.Components
    \endcode

    \section1 Reference

    \list
         \li \l{Qt Quick Studio Components QML Types}{QML Types}
    \endlist
*/
